  "id": "fundamental-skill",
  "term": "fundamental skill",
  "definition": "A fundamental skill is a basic human ability that supports effective action across many activities. In this source, it refers to an essential capacity such as intercepting moving objects, which depends on coordinated visual processing and motor control to adapt to changing environments.",
